  "38717e5e-bbae-4891-bc83-9c206b681138"],
 "\[LineSeparator]defines Global`applyMaps, letting ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Compute"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/Compute", 
