  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "454a5004-3c71-42d7-98aa-7095b81184bd"],
 " entries of Apply across parallel kernels."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->253,ExpressionUUID->"6033491d-c39b-42df-95ef-34672d9447a5"],

Cell["\<\
EnableParallelComputations[] defines Global`applyMaps, which Compute calls to \
apply the entries of its Apply option to computed components.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->254,ExpressionUUID->"1bed5afa-a262-412d-bf11-8dbc73b522e6"],

Cell["\<\
Until it is called, ParallelMap entries of $Apply have no effect.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->255,ExpressionUUID->"ca363338-7bf4-4d41-8a96-52e779c5ed46"],

Cell["\<\
It is normally placed in the initialization cell, next to SetAlias and \
SetDataDirectory. NewData[] writes it there.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->256,ExpressionUUID->"698f4b4f-334a-4b23-a563-d5442adf8b49"]
}, Open  ]],

